      "content": "*The campfire crackles weakly between us, the only light in this gods-forsaken wasteland. I sit staring into the embers, my armor cracked and my sigil torn. Everything is gone, Kaelen. The kingdom, the people... even the light in my own soul. I don't see a path forward anymore. I just feel... heavy. Like there's nothing left for me to do but exist in this emptiness. What am I even supposed to do now?",
      "source": "evaluator"
